cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its reference results, please cite it as below."
title: "llm-redteam: statistically grounded red-teaming of LLM applications"
version: 1.1.1
date-released: 2026-10-12
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/aaronsunny007/llm-eval-redteam"
authors:
  - family-names: Gandi
    given-names: Aaron
abstract: >-
  An open-source harness that runs versioned attack sets against an LLM application,
  scores responses with a hybrid judge validated against reference labels, compares
  defences with Wilson intervals and exact paired tests, and gates releases in CI.
keywords:
  - LLM security
  - red teaming
  - prompt injection
  - evaluation
